<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal> a pk1:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Ho et al. (2019) & Painter, Ho & Headon (2018) avian feather tracts on a curved trunk-and-limb surface: geodesic EDA competence wave, inhibitory-disk hexagonal packing, density-threshold tract boundaries and curvature-induced 5-7 dislocations (Embryonic chick (Gallus gallus) dorsal, humeral and femoral feather tracts E6.5-E7.5; Fc-chEDA1 / Ecto-D2 / methotrexate / Latrunculin A / scaleless (FGF20 sc/sc) perturbations)",
        "Ho et al. (2019) & Painter, Ho & Headon (2018) avian feather tracts on a curved trunk-and-limb surface: geodesic EDA competence wave, inhibitory-disk hexagonal packing, density-threshold tract boundaries and curvature-induced 5-7 dislocations faithfully reproduces Embryonic chick (Gallus gallus) dorsal, humeral and femoral feather tracts E6.5-E7.5; Fc-chEDA1 / Ecto-D2 / methotrexate / Latrunculin A / scaleless (FGF20 sc/sc) perturbations morphology" ;
