    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Embryonic chick (Gallus gallus) dorsal, humeral and femoral feather tracts E6.5-E7.5; Fc-chEDA1 / Ecto-D2 / methotrexate / Latrunculin A / scaleless (FGF20 sc/sc) perturbations specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 91.8/100, audit 2026-10-19-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-audit-v3) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py> ;
    schema:about "Embryonic chick (Gallus gallus) dorsal, humeral and femoral feather tracts E6.5-E7.5; Fc-chEDA1 / Ecto-D2 / methotrexate / Latrunculin A / scaleless (FGF20 sc/sc) perturbations" ;
